00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:20,719
These labels are even more.

290
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:21,560
About me...

291
00:12:21,561 --> 00:12:23,119
The thing is, I'm really proud.

292
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,479
Look, in your eyes,

293
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:26,279
I'm this kind of kid.

294
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:28,320
In acting, you can move up,

295
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:31,239
and you fall down again.

296
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:31,920
Since that's the case,

297
00:12:31,921 --> 00:12:33,039
