298
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:34,239
Still mess things up.

299
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,999
And that's when those feelings come.

300
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:39,679
And this doubt arises, this questioning.

301
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:42,960
The shift—why, confusion, resentment.

302
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:44,840
Just let it out.

303
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:47,279
After you let it out,

304
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:48,760
you pull it back in again.

305
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:51,679
Going deeper, ask yourself.

306
00:12:51,680 --> 00:12:52,560
This might all be

307
00:12:52,561 --> 00:12:54,280
labels others have given me.

308
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,959
I don't need to be

309
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:59,359
the kid in other people's eyes.

310
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,960
I just want to be myself.

311
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:04,959
Then one more thing to rein it in,

312
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:07,520
I think it would be really good.

313
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:09,240
Got it.

314
00:13:09,241 --> 00:13:11,839
Watching these transitions of yours makes me impatient.

315
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,919
A performance must have something

316
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:15,479
that makes people remember it.

317
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,559
Because I studied broadcasting.

318
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:18,159
Actually, in broadcasting we

319
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:19,559
sometimes need

320
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:22,039
a rather rational perspective

321
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:23,519
to deliver the news.

322
00:13:23,520 --> 00:13:25,559
But in acting, we need

323
00:13:25,560 --> 00:13:27,840
something more emotional.

324
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,399
I feel that

325
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:32,279
I still have a lot of room to improve.

326
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:34,279
I still have a long way to go.

327
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:35,599
Honestly, most of the time,

328
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:37,039
what I see is a host

329
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:38,759
judging these labels,

330
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:39,999
instead of you

331
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,999
growing together with them.

332
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:42,320
It's okay.

333
00:13:42,321 --> 00:13:43,959
In our upcoming classes,

334
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:45,439
let's work hard together, okay?

335
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:46,799
Alright, I think there's still a lot

336
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:48,319
I can learn from the teachers.

337
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:50,919
When the first label was put on just now.

338
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:51,959
I thought

339
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:54,839
