346
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:07,919
I think that's a real shame.

347
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:09,759
Still,

348
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:11,119
I really love the subject matter.

349
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,599
I think it's excellent.

350
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,640
Thank you, sir.

351
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:22,520
Hi everyone.

352
00:14:22,521 --> 00:14:23,959
