384
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:23,520
First way, say it excitedly:

385
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:26,919
I

386
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:28,240
Am Sun Mingyang.

387
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:33,440
Second way, say it angrily:

388
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,239
I

389
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,840
Am Sun Mingyang.

390
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:45,720
Third way,

391
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:47,400
