395
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:06,079
I

396
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,320
Am Sun Mingyang.

397
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:12,000
Fifth way,

398
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:14,680
