399
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:20,280
I am Sun Mingyang.

400
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:23,680
How's that?

401
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:27,000
Are you still there?

402
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:28,960
Hello?

403
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:33,800
I saw your comment in the chat.

404
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,480
Honestly,

405
00:16:38,840 --> 00:16:41,319
I also think this whole livestream-selling-myself

406
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:42,320
is pretty ridiculous.

407
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,880
I've gone to a lot of auditions,

408
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:49,319
