412
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,280
or the most skilled one.

413
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:01,840
But I love acting.

414
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:05,079
So I treat every livestream

415
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:07,280
as an audition opportunity given to me.

416
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:10,280
So even if there's just the tiniest chance,

417
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,320
I will definitely seize it.

418
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:14,720
Alright, let's stop here.

419
00:17:14,721 --> 00:17:17,759
If I keep going, you'll say I'm deliberately playing for sympathy,

420
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:19,079
