426
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:32,199
But while being fast,

427
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:33,759
can you project your voice,

428
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:35,959
so I can hear clearly what you're saying?

429
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:38,360
I think that loses you a few points.

430
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:41,119
Yes, I totally agree with Mr. Huang.

431
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:42,439
Your delivery is always

432
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:44,679
